//! Phase B — AEAD constructions (`CONFIGS.md` rows for the `crypto_aead_*`
//! group): aegis128l, aegis256, chacha20poly1305 (original 8-byte nonce),
//! chacha20poly1305_ietf, xchacha20poly1305_ietf, plus the aes256gcm
//! entry points (unavailable in this build — every operation must reject
//! identically in C and Rust).
//!
//! Both the *combined* and the *detached* entry points are exercised, with
//! message/AD lengths that straddle each primitive's block, absorb and
//! 128 KiB-chunk boundaries.
